<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Recently underwent (successful) mytosis. As this is a taxing process, some time for regeneration is required. While regenerating, no new mytosis can be started.-->
  <rjw_genes_mytosis_shock_hediff.description>近期刚经历过（成功的）有丝分裂。由于这是一个极其耗能的过程，需要一段时间进行再生恢复。在再生期间，无法启动新的有丝分裂。</rjw_genes_mytosis_shock_hediff.description>
  <!--EN: Mytosis Shock-->
  <rjw_genes_mytosis_shock_hediff.label>有丝分裂休克</rjw_genes_mytosis_shock_hediff.label>
  <!--EN: wearing off-->
  <rjw_genes_mytosis_shock_hediff.stages.0.label>即将消退</rjw_genes_mytosis_shock_hediff.stages.0.label>
  <!--EN: fresh-->
  <rjw_genes_mytosis_shock_hediff.stages.1.label>新生</rjw_genes_mytosis_shock_hediff.stages.1.label>
  <!--EN: Xenotypes with this Gene grow more unstable on orgasm - upon reaching critical level they will initate a process of mytosis.-->
  <rjw_genes_orgasmic_mytosis_hediff.description>带有此基因的异种人在高潮时会变得愈发不稳定——一旦达到临界水平，他们将启动有丝分裂过程。</rjw_genes_orgasmic_mytosis_hediff.description>
  <!--EN: Orgasmic Instability-->
  <rjw_genes_orgasmic_mytosis_hediff.label>高潮不稳定性</rjw_genes_orgasmic_mytosis_hediff.label>
  <!--EN: stable-->
  <rjw_genes_orgasmic_mytosis_hediff.stages.0.label>稳定</rjw_genes_orgasmic_mytosis_hediff.stages.0.label>
  <!--EN: agitated-->
  <rjw_genes_orgasmic_mytosis_hediff.stages.1.label>波动</rjw_genes_orgasmic_mytosis_hediff.stages.1.label>
  <!--EN: unstable-->
  <rjw_genes_orgasmic_mytosis_hediff.stages.2.label>不稳定</rjw_genes_orgasmic_mytosis_hediff.stages.2.label>
  <!--EN: critical-->
  <rjw_genes_orgasmic_mytosis_hediff.stages.3.label>临界</rjw_genes_orgasmic_mytosis_hediff.stages.3.label>
</LanguageData>
